# Issue: the BSV parser's imperative desugaring listed a block's updated
# variables in Ord Id order, i.e. string-intern order, so the tuple that
# threads them through the desugared code, and the .bo, depended on what
# the process had compiled before.
# Fix: the variables are listed by each name's first sighting in the file.
# Pull request: https://github.com/MatX-inc/bsc/pull/187
# Probe: LoopOrder's loop updates zz and aa; behind LoopOrderScramble, which
# interns aa first, the unfixed batched .bo dump swaps the tuple's components.

batching_bo_pair LoopOrder.bsv LoopOrderRoot.bsv LoopOrderScramble.bsv
